## CustomerSegmentApi

### Create customer segments
## Create customer segments
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/customer_segments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "audience_ids": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>"
}


### List customer segments
## List customer segments
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/customer_segments?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}&includeSizing={{includeSizing}}&searchQuery={{searchQuery}}
Accept: application/json

### Update customer segments
## Update customer segments
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/customer_segments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "audience_ids": "<string>",
 "id": "<string>",
 "operation_type": "<string>"
}

